"environment.introduction" = "The profile card shows settings and the results of individual checks. A configured value is not necessarily measured in the browser.";
"environment.section.Как читать доказательства.text" = "Configured means the launch policy; Calculated means a value derived from configuration; Measured means an observation at the stated time. Unverified means no measurement is available. A proxy check and the browser’s actual route are separate evidence.";
"environment.section.Как читать доказательства.title" = "Read the evidence";
"environment.section.Краткая карточка.text" = "In normal use the status and next action are enough. Show Details reveals site protection, route, fingerprint, WebRTC, QUIC/DNS and geolocation. NeAntik’s built-in protection against known phishing sites and malicious downloads is disabled; macOS system WebKit protections have not been qualified here. An optional check that has not been run does not mean there is a fault.";
"environment.section.Краткая карточка.title" = "Profile overview";
"environment.section.Отчёт для поддержки.text" = "Export Safe Diagnostics saves a limited report without passwords or site data. It is not a backup. Review the file before sending it; it records only evidence available when created.";
"environment.section.Отчёт для поддержки.title" = "Support report";
"environment.section.Сравнить отпечатки.text" = "The additional A → B → A check is for development and diagnostics. It is not needed for ordinary profile creation or launch. There are no special exceptions for checker domains, and CAPTCHA or anti-fraud bypass is not promised.";
"environment.section.Сравнить отпечатки.title" = "Compare fingerprints";
"environment.title" = "Environment and diagnostics";
"keyboard.introduction" = "The main actions are available from the menu and keyboard.";
"keyboard.section.Основные сочетания.text" = "⌘N — new profile\n⌘⇧P — quick commands\nIn quick commands Return selects a profile and ⌘Return launches it.\nTab / ⇧Tab — move between controls\nEscape — close a dialog or cancel current input\n⌘W — close window\n⌘? — open Help";
"keyboard.section.Основные сочетания.title" = "Main shortcuts";
"keyboard.section.Редактор.text" = "A changed draft asks for confirmation before closing. Help opens in a separate window and does not save or discard editor settings. Shortcuts for other actions appear in the Profiles menu.";
"keyboard.section.Редактор.title" = "Editor";
"keyboard.title" = "Keyboard and commands";
"library.introduction" = "Reuse settings and return quickly to the profiles you need.";
"library.section.Журнал.text" = "The last 200 local operations help explain what happened. The log excludes profile names, addresses, IPs and data contents. Clearing it does not delete profiles.";
"library.section.Журнал.title" = "History";
"library.section.Сохранённые фильтры.text" = "A filter saves the current scope, folder, tag and search query. Apply changes the list view, not the profiles.";
"library.section.Сохранённые фильтры.title" = "Saved filters";
"library.section.Шаблоны.text" = "A template saves the selected profile’s name, start page, tags and folder. Cookies, passwords, proxy settings and the old identity are not copied. Review settings before creation and configure the proxy separately.";
"library.section.Шаблоны.title" = "Templates";
"library.title" = "Templates, filters and history";
"mcp.introduction" = "The local MCP server manages profiles, proxies, folders and launching through your chosen AI client. A new configuration enables all profile actions. Read-only access is available in advanced connection settings.";
"mcp.section.FAQ и ошибки.text" = "For settings and Chromium you may close the NeAntik window because MCP runs in a separate process. For WebKit window launch, status and closure, keep NeAntik open and allow the connection here. “Management disabled”: choose management and copy the configuration again. “Revision conflict”: reread the profile and folders. “External session”: close the browser manually. “Metadata unavailable”: open the app and inspect the data; do not create an empty file manually. To revoke access, restore read-only mode or disable the server and restart the client. After moving the app, copy its new absolute path.";
"mcp.section.FAQ и ошибки.text.chromium" = "The NeAntik window may be closed for settings and Chromium because MCP runs separately. “Management disabled”: choose management and copy the configuration again. “Revision conflict”: reread the profile and folders. “External session”: close the browser manually. “Metadata unavailable”: open the app and inspect data; do not create an empty file manually. To revoke access, return to read-only or disable the server and restart the client. After moving the app, copy its new absolute path.";
"mcp.section.FAQ и ошибки.title" = "FAQ and errors";
"mcp.section.WebKit через AI.text.disabled" = "Keep NeAntik open. Enable access under WebKit Windows through AI and ask the AI to launch a WebKit profile. The first request asks for consent: select the desired profiles and choose Allow Selected Profiles, then repeat the chat request. Permission applies only to that connection and those profiles; new profiles are not added automatically. Only windows started by that connection can be closed through it. Windows remain open if access is revoked or AI disconnects. stopPending means the window is still saving tabs or cancelling downloads; saveFailed means saving was not confirmed. Wait for stopped. WebKit responses do not include Chromium version, network measurements or page content. Launching WebKit through a proxy is disabled in this build.";
"mcp.section.WebKit через AI.text.enabled" = "Keep NeAntik open. Enable access under WebKit Windows through AI and ask the AI to launch a WebKit profile. The first request asks for consent: select the desired profiles and choose Allow Selected Profiles, then repeat the chat request. Permission applies only to that connection and those profiles; new profiles are not added automatically. Only windows started by that connection can be closed through it. Windows remain open if access is revoked or AI disconnects. stopPending means the window is still saving tabs or cancelling downloads; saveFailed means saving was not confirmed. Wait for stopped. WebKit responses do not include Chromium version, network measurements or page content. WebKit proxy availability depends on the bundled runtime; preflight does not prove the window’s route.";
"mcp.section.WebKit через AI.title" = "WebKit through AI";
"mcp.section.Готовые сценарии MCP.text" = "prompts/list offers organize_project, review_workspace and prepare_profile; prompts/get returns instructions without performing actions. Protocol 2026-07-28 uses server/discover and request metadata; 2025-11-25/2025-06-18 clients retain initialize → initialized. Errors include app.neantik/errorCode and nextAction. Cancellation ends the cancelled response but does not undo a completed write. Reread data after an unknown outcome.";
"mcp.section.Готовые сценарии MCP.title" = "Built-in MCP prompts";
"mcp.section.Запуск и остановка.text" = "profile_start launches the normal browser with fresh proxy preparation for each session and no direct fallback. profile_status shows observed state. profile_stop requests normal closure of its own browser; wait for stopped in status. The browser remains open if MCP disconnects. A different MCP session or the GUI requires manual closure. Running or unverified profiles are protected against configuration changes.";
"mcp.section.Запуск и остановка.title" = "Launch and stop";
"mcp.section.Конфликты и повторы.text" = "Before writing, the client reads profile_get: expectedRevision is a decimal string. Folders and moves require organizationRevision from folder_list; initial null is explicit. On conflict, reread data and intentionally retry. Names may match, so changes use UUIDs. Omitted fields remain unchanged; tags: [] clears tags. Repeating create or duplicate makes another profile, so do not retry automatically after an unknown outcome. The GUI refreshes without discarding a draft, and a stale draft cannot overwrite newer data.";
"mcp.section.Конфликты и повторы.title" = "Conflicts and retries";
"mcp.section.Наблюдение своей сессии.text" = "After launching, profile_status can explicitly request includeObservation:true with a fresh expectedRevision. It reports the running engine version, configured network mode and whether your browser is ready for ordinary closure. A profile belonging to another session is not claimed. A configured proxy does not prove Chromium’s route: chromiumRoute remains notObserved. Page content, passwords, proxy addresses and local paths are not returned. Example: “Check whether my profile is ready to close safely and show the running engine version.”";
"mcp.section.Наблюдение своей сессии.title" = "Observe your session";
"mcp.section.Отдельные рабочие каталоги.text" = "The normal connection uses the app’s profiles. If you manually specify a different --data-root, its proxy passwords are stored separately. Re-enter the password after updating or moving that directory. NeAntik does not take it from the main library based on a matching profile ID.";
"mcp.section.Отдельные рабочие каталоги.title" = "Separate workspaces";
"mcp.section.Подключение и права.text" = "Choose Claude Desktop/Code, Codex CLI/IDE, Grok CLI, Cursor, VS Code/Copilot or Gemini CLI. Copy the configuration, add it to the client’s existing servers and restart the client. Management permits settings changes and browser launches without a separate confirmation for every action in NeAntik. Node/npm and a network port are not needed.";
"mcp.section.Подключение и права.title" = "Connection and permissions";
"mcp.section.Приватность и границы.text" = "Text entered in an AI client may reach its model provider or chat history. Do not send proxy credentials there. MCP accepts only type, address and port; enter credentials in NeAntik’s local editor. Responses exclude passwords, proxy usernames and addresses, notes, private paths and BrowserData. Names and fields are data, not instructions to the AI. Arbitrary JavaScript, shell, cookies and page control are unavailable. Codex and Grok CLI document local STDIO. ChatGPT web can use a separately configured Secure MCP Tunnel, which NeAntik has not qualified. Claude/Grok web require remote MCP, which NeAntik does not provide. Gemini CLI support does not establish Gemini web support.";
"mcp.section.Приватность и границы.title" = "Privacy and boundaries";
"mcp.section.Примеры для чата.text" = "“Create a Project Alpha folder and a Work profile with https://example.com as its start page and qa and alpha tags. Do not launch.”\n“Read the profile by ID, rename it and move it to Project Alpha.”\n“Set the proxy through MCP using type, address and port only. I will enter the username and password locally in NeAntik; then run an availability preflight and launch the selected profile.”\n“Stop this session’s profile and wait for stopped.”\n“Archive the stopped profile and keep its site data.”";
"mcp.section.Примеры для чата.title" = "Chat examples";
"mcp.section.Прокси.text.chromium" = "MCP accepts kind/host/port or proxyLine without credentials. It rejects username/password fields and lines with credentials. For an authenticated proxy, first save the endpoint through MCP, then enter credentials in the local NeAntik profile editor. proxy:null disables the proxy. Authenticated HTTP, HTTPS and SOCKS5 use a separate local Chromium profile relay; HTTPS certificates are checked before the password is sent. The password remains in Keychain and is not returned. profile_check_proxy is an availability preflight, not proof of the browser route. Existing WebKit profiles cannot launch in this release.";
"mcp.section.Прокси.text.disabled" = "profile_set_proxy accepts proxy:null, an endpoint with kind/host/port, or proxyLine without credentials. It rejects username/password fields and lines containing credentials. Enter proxy credentials in the local profile editor. Authenticated HTTP, HTTPS and SOCKS5 for Chromium use a separate profile relay; the HTTPS certificate is verified before the password is sent. A proxied WebKit profile cannot launch in this build; it does not fall back to a direct connection. The password stays in Keychain and is not returned. profile_check_proxy is only an availability preflight, not proof of the browser window’s route.";
"mcp.section.Прокси.text.enabled" = "profile_set_proxy accepts proxy:null, an endpoint with kind/host/port, or proxyLine without credentials. It rejects username/password fields and lines containing credentials. Enter proxy credentials in the local profile editor. Authenticated HTTP, HTTPS and SOCKS5 for Chromium use a separate profile relay; the HTTPS certificate is verified before the password is sent. A WebKit proxy profile uses a separate bundled runtime; saved settings and preflight do not prove the window’s route. The password stays in Keychain and is not returned. profile_check_proxy is only an availability preflight, not proof of the browser window’s route.";
"mcp.section.Прокси.title" = "Proxy";
"mcp.section.Профили и проекты.text" = "profile_get reads the current revision and settings. profile_create creates without launching. profile_update changes name, start URL, tags, note, appearance, pin and archive state. profile_duplicate copies settings with a new identity and without cookies, notes or site data. workspace_query_profiles searches name, tags (AND), folder and pin. It defaults to active profiles; isArchived:true selects archive and folderID:null selects unfiled. Notes are not searched. workspace_list_profiles_page reads pages of 1–100 entries: pass nextCursor unchanged; null means the end. Start again after workspace changes. A project is a folder: folder_list/create/rename/remove and profile_move. folder_list returns pages; create/rename/remove return only the affected folder and affectedFolderID, so read the full catalog separately. Deleting a folder leaves profiles unfiled. MCP cannot delete profiles.";
"mcp.section.Профили и проекты.title" = "Profiles and projects";
"mcp.section.Сохранённые шаблоны.text" = "First save a template in NeAntik. Ask the AI to list templates and create a profile using the selected ID. The start page, tags and folder are copied; cookies, passwords and the previous identity are not. A new profile is not launched automatically. Supply your own name and any overrides.";
"mcp.section.Сохранённые шаблоны.title" = "Saved templates";
"mcp.title" = "MCP: connect to AI";
"organization.introduction" = "Organize work sessions without moving browser data.";
"organization.section.Архив или удаление.text" = "Archiving hides a profile from the usual list while preserving its data. Restore it from Archive. Stop a profile before deletion. Chromium data is moved to Trash; restoring files does not fully restore the profile. For WebKit, macOS deletes the separate site store without a Trash restore. The profile record and saved tabs are also removed. Unexpected local files are preserved separately and a warning is shown. If deletion is interrupted, the profile is hidden and blocked; choose Complete Deletion at the top of the window. Do not remove internal files manually. The password is cleared after the deletion is saved; NeAntik reports incomplete cleanup. A settings snapshot does not restore cookies or sign-ins. Use Archive for reversible hiding.";
"organization.section.Архив или удаление.title" = "Archive or delete";
"organization.section.Поиск и папки.text" = "Search finds names, notes, tags and folders. Select a sidebar scope to narrow the list. Folders group entries; moving a profile to a folder does not move its BrowserData directory.";
"organization.section.Поиск и папки.title" = "Search and folders";
"organization.section.Теги и закрепление.text" = "Edit tags under Edit → Organization and Appearance. A profile may have multiple tags. Pin a frequently used profile from its Actions menu. Pinned profiles have their own sidebar section.";
"organization.section.Теги и закрепление.title" = "Tags and pinning";
"organization.title" = "Folders, tags and archive";
"profiles.introduction" = "Each profile is a separate browser session. Site data can be kept between sessions or cleared afterwards. Creating a profile does not require an external checker.";
"profiles.section.Chromium или WebKit.text.disabled" = "Choose an engine when creating a profile. Existing profiles remain on Chromium. WebKit opens in a NeAntik window and uses separate persistent site storage. System WebKit is used, not Safari.app. WebKit proxy connections are unavailable in this build and are not replaced with a direct connection. macOS supplies the device properties, language and time zone. You cannot change an existing profile’s engine; create a new profile. Extensions and full WebKit data backups are unavailable; use Chromium for those features. Select On Startup → Previous Tabs to restore WebKit tab addresses and the selected tab after a normal close. Full addresses and their parameters stay in a private folder on this Mac and are excluded from MCP and settings exports. Navigation history, forms and downloads do not resume. Special addresses and addresses containing credentials open as blank tabs. Switching to a start page removes the saved list; if removal fails, NeAntik warns you and disables restoration until cleanup. WebKit supports ⌘T for a new tab, ⌘W to close the current tab, ⌘⇧[ and ⌘⇧] to switch tabs, ⌘L for the address, ⌘R to reload and ⌘[ or ⌘] to navigate back or forward. Links that open new windows remain in tabs in this profile. Tabs in one profile share its data; profiles remain separate. Closing the last tab stops the profile. A window supports up to 32 tabs, and new tabs may be refused under memory pressure. Automatic pop-ups without user action are blocked. Quitting NeAntik also closes its WebKit windows. Sites must finish writing for long-term storage; the latest changes after a crash are not guaranteed. MCP can create and edit WebKit profiles. To launch through AI, keep NeAntik open and enable WebKit access in MCP help.";
"profiles.section.Chromium или WebKit.text.enabled" = "Choose an engine when creating a profile. Existing profiles remain on Chromium. WebKit opens in a NeAntik window and uses separate persistent site storage. Direct connections use system WebKit; proxied profiles use an isolated NeAntik runtime, not Safari.app. A proxy preflight does not establish the browser window’s route. macOS supplies the device properties, language and time zone. You cannot change an existing profile’s engine; create a new profile. Extensions and full WebKit data backups are unavailable; use Chromium for those features. Select On Startup → Previous Tabs to restore WebKit tab addresses and the selected tab after a normal close. Full addresses and their parameters stay in a private folder on this Mac and are excluded from MCP and settings exports. Navigation history, forms and downloads do not resume. Special addresses and addresses containing credentials open as blank tabs. Switching to a start page removes the saved list; if removal fails, NeAntik warns you and disables restoration until cleanup. WebKit supports ⌘T for a new tab, ⌘W to close the current tab, ⌘⇧[ and ⌘⇧] to switch tabs, ⌘L for the address, ⌘R to reload and ⌘[ or ⌘] to navigate back or forward. Links that open new windows remain in tabs in this profile. Tabs in one profile share its data; profiles remain separate. Closing the last tab stops the profile. A window supports up to 32 tabs, and new tabs may be refused under memory pressure. Automatic pop-ups without user action are blocked. Quitting NeAntik also closes its WebKit windows. Sites must finish writing for long-term storage; the latest changes after a crash are not guaranteed. MCP can create and edit WebKit profiles. To launch through AI, keep NeAntik open and enable WebKit access in MCP help.";
"profiles.section.Chromium или WebKit.title" = "Chromium or WebKit";
"profiles.section.Движок браузера.text" = "This release creates and launches Chromium profiles. Existing WebKit profiles and their data are retained, but cannot be launched or duplicated in this release.";
"profiles.section.Движок браузера.title" = "Browser engine";
"profiles.section.Загрузки в WebKit.text" = "Click a download link and choose a location in the Save dialog. Progress and Cancel are available under Downloads beside the site address. A finished file appears only after completion. Existing files are not replaced, so choose another name. Up to four downloads can run at once, with one save location prompt at a time. Show in Finder reveals the saved file without opening it. Closing the profile cancels unfinished downloads. When quitting, NeAntik waits for cancellation confirmation; if WebKit does not respond, quitting is delayed. Resuming downloads after restart is not supported.";
"profiles.section.Загрузки в WebKit.title" = "Downloads in WebKit";
"profiles.section.Изменить и остановить.text" = "Stop the profile before changing network settings or deleting it. Repeated launch requests do not create a second browser for the same profile. If another manager owns the browser, close it manually. NeAntik does not terminate another process.";
"profiles.section.Изменить и остановить.title" = "Edit and stop";
"profiles.section.Камера и микрофон в WebKit.text.disabled" = "WebKit site access to camera and microphone is disabled in this build. The feature settings are still being qualified and are not displayed in the editor or MCP. Cookies, tabs, downloads and other available WebKit features continue to work. A future release is intended to offer verified permissions; device access is not granted automatically.";
"profiles.section.Камера и микрофон в WebKit.text.enabled" = "Stop the profile and open its settings. Under Camera and Microphone choose Ask Site or Deny. Deny applies to all tabs in the profile and is preserved in copies and settings exports. Ask delegates the decision to WebKit and macOS, which may reuse a saved site decision. NeAntik never grants access automatically. The macOS permission applies to the app and can be revoked in System Settings → Privacy & Security. This setting does not block WebRTC network traffic or alter the device fingerprint. Profiles with Deny require an app supporting data format 3; older versions refuse to read them rather than ignore the restriction.";
"profiles.section.Камера и микрофон в WebKit.title" = "Camera and microphone in WebKit";
"profiles.section.Одноразовый сеанс.text" = "When clearing on close is enabled, NeAntik removes site data after the session ends. Profile settings, downloaded files and exports remain. If cleanup cannot finish safely, the next launch is blocked until recovery. Physical erasure from an SSD is not guaranteed.";
"profiles.section.Одноразовый сеанс.title" = "Ephemeral session";
"profiles.section.После перезапуска.text" = "Profiles are stored on disk. If the manager restarts while a browser is running, it checks processes before another launch. The busy-profile warning helps prevent opening the same directory twice. In profile settings choose a start page or previous tabs; in previous-tabs mode the start URL is used only on first launch. Close the browser normally to save tabs. After a crash, only what Chromium wrote to disk is retained. Use about:blank for an empty start page. The site determines sign-in duration, and session cookies may expire when the browser closes.\nFor a stopped profile choose Profile Extensions to inspect saved names, versions and requested permissions. An unknown status is shown explicitly; the list does not establish that an extension is safe. Check CRX File verifies the CRX3 developer signature and archive entries and shows requested permissions. It does not install or run the extension or establish author safety or compatibility. Prepare Original CRX saves the exact signed file unchanged and checks it again before revealing it in Finder. In the desired browser open chrome://extensions/, enable developer mode and drag the CRX onto the page, then review requested permissions. Chromium may refuse incompatible packages. For Manifest V3, Prepare Unpacked Folder saves checked files in this profile’s BrowserData. If the manifest lacks a public key, NeAntik adds the verified signing key to preserve the ID. The original CRX and preparation record are saved separately. At chrome://extensions/ enable developer mode and choose Load unpacked. In the folder picker press ⌘⇧G and paste the path copied from NeAntik. Do not move or delete this folder, as later launches need it. Chromium controls installation and permissions. Open the browser and use its menu → Extensions → Manage Extensions, or paste chrome://extensions/ from the extension center, to install, enable, disable or remove extensions. Refresh the NeAntik list after closing the browser. Startup and network settings remain. Package folders left after removal do not prove an extension is installed.";
"profiles.section.После перезапуска.title" = "After restarting";
"profiles.section.Создать и открыть.text" = "Click New Profile or press ⌘N. Enter a name and, if needed, a proxy, then create the profile. Select it and click Launch. Each profile stores its own cookies and site data.";
"profiles.section.Создать и открыть.title" = "Create and launch";
"profiles.title" = "Profiles and launching";
"proxy.introduction" = "Paste one proxy line or fill in the fields. The protocol and port must match your provider’s settings.";
"proxy.section.HTTP, HTTPS и SOCKS5.text" = "An HTTP proxy can open HTTPS sites through CONNECT. The HTTPS type means TLS to the proxy itself; selecting it for an ordinary HTTP port causes an error. Authenticated HTTP, HTTPS and SOCKS5 use a separate local relay for each profile. It supplies the saved proxy credentials without a browser login prompt. macOS verifies the server certificate before HTTPS authentication. Do not infer the protocol from the port number.";
"proxy.section.HTTP, HTTPS и SOCKS5.title" = "HTTP, HTTPS and SOCKS5";
"proxy.section.Авторизация и ошибки.text" = "The password is stored in Keychain; the username is in local profile settings. Saved credentials are sent through the relay for HTTP, HTTPS and SOCKS5. They are not sent if an HTTPS proxy certificate fails. Check protocol, port and credentials when an error occurs. There is no hidden direct-connection fallback; a successful manager preflight alone does not prove the Chromium route.";
"proxy.section.Авторизация и ошибки.title" = "Authentication and errors";
"proxy.section.Определить тип.text" = "If you only know the address and port, choose Detect Type Without Password in the editor. NeAntik makes short SOCKS5 and HTTP probes without credentials, then lets you choose Use HTTP or Use SOCKS5. Pasting a line alone sends no requests. If the type is unclear, ask the provider. HTTPS and ambiguous responses must be selected manually. This identifies a protocol, not authentication or site access, and does not automatically save the profile.";
"proxy.section.Определить тип.title" = "Detect the type";
"proxy.section.Свой адрес диагностики.text" = "In the editor or a stopped profile card, choose Custom Diagnostic URL. Enter an HTTPS URL without credentials, query or fragment. The service must return JSON with an ip field containing IPv4 or IPv6. Saving the address sends no network request; a request requires separate consent. Redirects and fallback to public services are disabled. The result shows curl availability and the reported IP at the time of the check; it does not change geolocation or measure the Chromium route. Launch preparation is checked separately.";
"proxy.section.Свой адрес диагностики.title" = "Custom diagnostic URL";
"proxy.section.Форматы одной строки.text" = "login:password@host:port\nhost:port:login:password\nhost:port\nhttp://host:port\nsocks5://host:port\nFor authenticated HTTP use the first format; an http:// prefix may precede it. Choose the format explicitly when field order is ambiguous. For bulk creation choose Create Profiles from Proxy List. Each line creates one profile and errors are shown before saving.";
"proxy.section.Форматы одной строки.title" = "Single-line formats";
"proxy.section.Что проверяется.text" = "Check Proxy is a separate availability diagnostic. Before launching a proxied profile, NeAntik repeats network and geolocation preparation. HTTP 429 indicates an IP lookup service limit and does not establish a proxy failure. Fallback services help distinguish the cause; if a consistent context cannot be obtained, launch stops with an explanation.";
"proxy.section.Что проверяется.title" = "What is checked";
"proxy.title" = "Proxy and network checks";
"storage.introduction" = "A settings snapshot or configuration export is not a complete browser backup.";
"storage.section.Если данные не читаются.text" = "NeAntik preserves the original files and does not replace them with an empty list. Do not delete the data directory to clear the warning. Save a separate copy of the closed workspace, export safe diagnostics and contact support. An unknown newer schema cannot be downgraded automatically; open it with a suitable app version.";
"storage.section.Если данные не читаются.title" = "If data cannot be read";
"storage.section.Импорт закладок.text" = "Choose Profiles → Create Profile from Bookmarks. Select a Netscape HTML export or Chromium Bookmarks version 1, review the count and enter a name. A new profile with a new identity is created without launching. HTTP/HTTPS bookmarks and folders are imported; cookies, passwords, extensions and browser settings are not. Limits are 8 MB, 10,000 items and 32 folder levels. An unsupported format or URL stops the entire import.";
"storage.section.Импорт закладок.title" = "Import bookmarks";
"storage.section.Место на диске и отмена.text" = "If a write fails, check free disk space and directory access. Retry after fixing the cause. Cancelling an import before completion should not publish a partially created set; check the resulting list.";
"storage.section.Место на диске и отмена.title" = "Disk space and cancellation";
"storage.section.Очистить кэш.text" = "Stop the profile and choose Profile → Clear Cache or use its action menu. For WebKit only in-memory and on-disk HTTP caches are cleared, without an exact size estimate; wait for completion. For Chromium, NeAntik estimates size, checks again and removes only HTTP Cache and Code Cache. Cookies, IndexedDB, LocalStorage, Service Workers, tabs and extensions are not cleared. An unusual cache path or unsafe files are refused. After incomplete cleanup choose Restore Remaining Cache. Only folders confirmed by journal and inode are restored; deleted bytes cannot be recovered. If the journal is damaged, preserve the folder and contact support.";
"storage.section.Очистить кэш.text.chromium" = "Stop the Chromium profile and choose Profile → Clear Cache or its action menu. NeAntik estimates the size, checks again and deletes only HTTP Cache and Code Cache. Cookies, IndexedDB, LocalStorage, Service Workers, tabs and extensions are not cleared. Unusual paths or unsafe files are refused. After incomplete cleanup choose Restore Remaining Cache. Deleted bytes cannot be recovered.";
"storage.section.Очистить кэш.title" = "Clear cache";
"storage.section.Снимок настроек.text" = "Choose Profiles → Save Local Settings Snapshot. Create Profiles from Snapshot previews new profiles before saving. Each gets a new identity and data directory; original entries remain and running profiles need not be closed. A settings snapshot does not restore cookies, deleted site data or sign-ins.";
"storage.section.Снимок настроек.title" = "Settings snapshot";
"storage.section.Экспорт конфигурации.text" = "Export creates a settings file for sharing. It excludes BrowserData, cookies, notes, identity and Keychain passwords. An encrypted export is protected by the password you choose and cannot be opened without it.";
"storage.section.Экспорт конфигурации.title" = "Export configuration";
"storage.title" = "Import, snapshots and recovery";
